  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countering Backlash &#x2013; Reclaiming Women&#x2019;s Rights in Jordan - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support four Jordanian women&#x2019;s rights organizations (Arab Women Organization of Jordan (AWO), Takatoat and two grassroots women&#x2019;s rights organizations), and their work on women&#x2019;s human rights and protection from gender-based violence (GBV). Target groups are women in marginalized communities and refugees but also women rights activists (WRA) in the region. Men and boys will be reached through GBV awareness raising sessions in communities.</narrative>
  </description>
